    "A Homebrew operation is still in progress. Quitting while Homebrew is working may leave the affected app in an incomplete state." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Homebrew 操作仍在进行中。此时退出可能会让相关应用处于不完整状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A previous update left an old copy of the app inside Homebrew's records, and Homebrew refuses every upgrade until it's cleared. Repair removes the leftover copy and reinstalls the app fresh — your settings and data are kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上一次更新在 Homebrew 的记录中残留了该应用的旧副本，在清除之前 Homebrew 会拒绝所有升级。「修复」会移除残留副本并重新全新安装——你的设置和数据会被保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
