    "macOS only lets CaskHub modify other apps once you grant it the App Management permission, and adopting %@ may need to do that. Enable CaskHub under System Settings → Privacy & Security → App Management (a system notification may also offer it), then come back — the adoption will finish on its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
